Several of Zendr's features (the notifications inbox, attention rings, the sidebar's
ports, pull request and notification line, agent summaries) are inspired by cmux
(https://cmux.com) by Manaflow. No cmux code is included.

The mods in config/ that are clones of Herdr's built-in mods (review-tabs, review-menu,
review-toast, review-pane, review-spaces, review-agents, review-changes) name the mod and
version they came from in their mod.json (cloned_from), and stay under the Apache
License 2.0.
